<title>FRANCE: Two wheat ships expected in Rouen by September 12.</title>
<headline>Two wheat ships expected in Rouen by September 12.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two ships were expected in Rouen by September 12 to load some 16,500 tonnes of wheat, port officials said on Tuesday. The destination was not specified.</p>
<p>In Rouen, two ships are currently loading 48,000 tonnes of wheat destined for Cuba and Italy, they said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5432</p>
</text>
